@startuml
|Delivery Driver|
start
:Arrive at Warehouse Dock;
:Hand over Delivery Manifest;

|Warehouse Operator|
:Receive Delivery Manifest;
:Locate corresponding PO in System;
if (PO Found & Approved?) then (yes)
  :Unload Goods;
  :Perform Quality Inspection;
  if (Goods Damaged?) then (yes)
    :Quarantine Damaged Items;
    :Log Discrepancy/Damage Report;
  else (no)
    :Count received quantities;
  endif
  :Enter Goods Receipt (GR) in System;
  
  |System|
  :Update Inventory Quantities;
  :Update PO Status (Partial/Fulfilled);
  
  |Warehouse Operator|
  :Put away items to Storage Bins;
else (no)
  :Reject Delivery;
  :Return Goods to Driver;
endif
stop
@enduml
